[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3255821791","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110259#issuecomment-3255821791","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110259","id":3255821791,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7CD-Xf","user":{"login":"ktxyz","id":67782157,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NzgyMTU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67782157?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz","html_url":"https://github.com/ktxyz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T21:37:32Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T21:37:32Z","body":"I moved the name as prefix to the actual message so it doesn't impact translation in any way, unlike having it as `Invalid Name: %s`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3255821791/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3256143390","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110259#issuecomment-3256143390","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110259","id":3256143390,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7CFM4e","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T22:56:20Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T22:56:20Z","body":"I would expect it to look like this instead:\r\n\r\n```\r\nCan't add Autoload: invalid name.\r\nGlobalTetrahedron: Must not collide with an existing global script class name.\r\n```\r\n\r\nNotice the lowercase \"i\" for \"invalid name\", and the fact it's on the same line as the \"header\" of the error dialog.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3256143390/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3256301934","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110259#issuecomment-3256301934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110259","id":3256301934,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7CFzlu","user":{"login":"ktxyz","id":67782157,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NzgyMTU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67782157?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz","html_url":"https://github.com/ktxyz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ktxyz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T23:21:20Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T23:21:48Z","body":"> I would expect it to look like this instead:\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n> Can't add Autoload: invalid name.\r\n> GlobalTetrahedron: Must not collide with an existing global script class name.\r\n> ```\r\n> \r\n> Notice the lowercase \"i\" for \"invalid name\", and the fact it's on the same line as the \"header\" of the error dialog.\r\n\r\nThe \"header\" part only really exists for invalid name and not other options\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nif (!_autoload_name_is_valid(name, &error)) {\r\n  EditorNode::get_singleton()->show_warning(TTR(\"Can't add Autoload:\") + \"\\n\" + error);\r\n  return false;\r\n}\r\n\r\nif (!FileAccess::exists(p_path)) {\r\n  EditorNode::get_singleton()->show_warning(TTR(\"Can't add Autoload:\") + \"\\n\" + vformat(TTR(\"%s is an invalid path. File does not exist.\"), p_path));\r\n  return false;\r\n}\r\n\r\nif (!p_path.begins_with(\"res://\")) {\r\n  EditorNode::get_singleton()->show_warning(TTR(\"Can't add Autoload:\") + \"\\n\" + vformat(TTR(\"%s is an invalid path. Not in resource path (res://).\"), p_path));\r\n  return false;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo this would have us\r\n```\r\nCan't add Autoload: invalid name.\r\n%s: Must not collide with an existing global script class name.\r\n---\r\nCan't add Autoload:\r\n%s is an invalid path. File does not exist.\r\n---\r\nCan't add Autoload:\r\n%s is an invalid path. Not in resource path (res://).\r\n```\r\n\r\nHow about\r\n```\r\nCan't add Autoload:\r\n%s is an invalid name. Must not collide with an existing global script class name.\r\n---\r\nCan't add Autoload:\r\n%s is an invalid path. File does not exist.\r\n---\r\nCan't add Autoload:\r\n%s is an invalid path. Not in resource path (res://).\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis has message formats the same for each case and only requires `'%s is an invalid name.'` translation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3256301934/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3320761403","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110259#issuecomment-3320761403","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110259","id":3320761403,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7F7sw7","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-22T18:39:24Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T18:39:24Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3320761403/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]